{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bf6e568b1a6780407b1a840b5caa96fd876dc10f8f3fed81943a1658d3ca2388", "ja": "（今日はコスプレグラビア企画の撮影だ。遊園地内の\nカフェとのコラボで、美奈子は張り切っている）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄角色扮演写真企划。由于要和游乐园里的咖啡厅合作，美奈子干劲十足。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6e7eab41d12b15be6d2246be6afd08278fd56cabcd54d4b7199d41e214c2f9ef", "ja": "お疲れさま、美奈子。\nコラボフードの準備は……？", "zh": "辛苦了，美奈子。\n联动餐点准备得……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "c4f88896c657efd302a9c950e7860ac44f04d64a090eced5514d1a548f85b2d8", "ja": "はい、{$P$}さん！\n用意はバッチリです！", "zh": "好的，{$P$}先生！\n已经准备得妥妥当当啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "2316a1afba3591184222b7092d198b84215ac138575f7263915fc7e1ed73adc6", "ja": "『ワンぱく・ホットドッグ』は、小さな子でも\n食べやすいように甘～いマンゴーサルサ味で。", "zh": "“淘气汪热狗”做成了甜甜的芒果莎莎酱口味，即使是小孩子也很容易吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "bdef6727181e377ec56a52a359652b31c6c84b8edb3df90968c925c1c5c1649d", "ja": "もうひとつの『ワンワン・ホットドッグ』は、\nワンちゃんも食べられる食材で作ったんですよ！", "zh": "另一份“汪汪热狗”则是用狗狗也能吃的食材制作的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2892b50c3ec698a9a1fbdef9effeacf5dea4bed77bed267b88c8271a42569b98", "ja": "おお～。犬用のコラボメニューまで考えるなんて……\nさすが美奈子だな！", "zh": "哦～居然连给狗狗吃的联动菜单都想到了……不愧是美奈子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "225c82c230d8f9afe60534701471cf1c4b4e1689a386da05d2caad3b885b7e4d", "ja": "えへへ♪　カフェの資料に『ペット同伴可』\nって書いてあって。それで思いついたんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪咖啡馆的资料上写着“可以携带宠物”，所以我就想到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "654bc360b61406fa5f717d7a09c4e55b66cebc743345717b769d6d1e1727304a", "ja": "お客さんは、ペットと遊びに来てる人達ですよね？\nそれなら、ご飯も一緒に食べたいじゃないですか。", "zh": "客人们都是带着宠物来玩的人吧？\n既然这样，当然也想和它们一起吃饭啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "6f0e69f5c4d2f7e1292ab98fe76abae685e7ce464532e5474bccdcaf03ffb016", "ja": "今回はワンちゃん用だけですけど、ネコちゃんとか\nウサちゃんのも用意した方がよかったですかね……？", "zh": "这次只有狗狗用的，不过是不是也该准备一些猫咪和兔子用的呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1009_p", "source_sha256": "eb60fcf38d7d97961fea357ca49cdeed54262ae94c2c64d6faf0cfc676609832", "ja": "美奈子の気持ちはわかるよ。\nただ今回の撮影は犬の衣装だからなぁ……。", "zh": "我明白美奈子的心情。不过这次拍摄的是狗狗的服装啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "11574a1545317f438db0745dc46af4acdcb14d6d63530c06d0bd485b0b674fb3", "ja": "そうですよね……。またいつか、機会があれば\n他のペットのメニューも考えてみたいです。", "zh": "是啊……如果以后有机会，我还想再为其他宠物设计菜单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "d1e5b7eac6a3488607ff8a8ae853187b47fa84eabc597737e640906bceac5b0f", "ja": "ネコちゃんなら……え～と、なんだろう？\nかつおぶしと……。", "zh": "如果是猫咪的话……呃～，该做什么好呢？\n鲣鱼干和……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1012_p", "source_sha256": "52901d0440314a7bac75c25cb80b64fdb4564a1faea2ceea1b6e804c131b89e8", "ja": "ははっ。楽しみなのはわかるけど、\n今は撮影に集中してほしいかな。", "zh": "哈哈。我知道你很期待，不过现在还是请专心拍摄吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "3cb61e844378ced021e3116abb40d2e1cc3d4af33791b0d7bbdecca087205c99", "ja": "あ、いけない。……えへへ。\nちゃんと撮影も頑張ります！　あの、それから……。", "zh": "啊，不好。……嘿嘿。\n我也会好好努力拍摄的！那个，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "bfbb41ad85feca014bbeb3d9c552a7979c198f8a36b4782fc78527a585eac2c3", "ja": "撮影が終わったら、一緒に食べませんか？\nこのホットドッグ……私の自信作なんです♪", "zh": "拍摄结束后，要不要一起吃？\n这个热狗……可是我的得意之作哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0513_1015_p", "source_sha256": "04d5559f0744bb121f89582ec2d0ad26dcbcc5bf691b64f55412903b24677baf", "ja": "（その後、美奈子はとびきりの笑顔を見せてくれてた。\n次のコラボの機会は、案外すぐにやってくるかもな）", "zh": "（之后，美奈子对我露出了格外灿烂的笑容。下一次合作的机会，说不定意外地很快就会到来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
